#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186392722 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9fde686e-0040-50c8-9b9b-1ad4f1e8aaa2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{{({e}^{t}+1)}^{2}},\\,5{t}^{4}⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392724} {:answer/id #uuid "d02ac812-19ad-5839-9ad9-16c2a59beade" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨\\frac{{e}^{t}}{{({e}^{t}+1)}^{2}},\\,5{t}^{4}⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392725} {:answer/id #uuid "bc4ffd3e-cd2a-5031-83aa-72de86237fff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{{({e}^{t}+1)}^{2}},\\,5t⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392726} {:answer/id #uuid "dd140ea3-6577-5157-ab09-4fefef73b8e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨\\frac{2{e}^{2t}-{e}^{t}}{{({e}^{t}+1)}^{2}},\\,{t}^{4}⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392727} {:answer/id #uuid "37a5973e-637b-5d29-9329-f2c326b69242" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "⟨\\frac{{e}^{t}}{{({e}^{t}+1)}^{2}},\\,5t⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392728}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186392725} :answer-field/id #uuid "03ef94ed-b793-5302-a468-c42ecf1df591" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392723}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "607151f7-a0f9-522f-b6fe-540456f7af54" :question/math-academy-id "q-50371" :question/problem "Given that $r(t)=⟨\\frac{{e}^{t}}{{e}^{t}+1},\\,{t}^{5}⟩,$ ${r}^{′}(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "We differentiate each component separately.\n\n- For the $x$-component $x(t)=\\frac{{e}^{t}}{{e}^{t}+1},$ we have\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\frac{{e}^{t}({e}^{t}+1)-{e}^{t}\\cdot {e}^{t}}{{({e}^{t}+1)}^{2}}=\\frac{{e}^{t}}{{({e}^{t}+1)}^{2}}.\n$$\n\n- For the $y$-component $y(t)={t}^{5},$ we have\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}(t)=5{t}^{4}.\n$$\n\nSo, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨{x}^{′}(t),\\,{y}^{′}(t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{{e}^{t}}{{({e}^{t}+1)}^{2}},\\,5{t}^{4}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
